        <h1>Investigation of whole-genome cloning and transplantation 
	using the quasi-minimal bacterium <i>Mesoplasma florum</i></h1>
	<p>
	Sequence of the <i>Mesoplasma florum L1</i> cloned in <i>Saccharomyces cerevisiae</i> in fasta 
	format as well as in partially annotated GenBank. This sequence was confirmed by 
	sequencing the <i>S. cerevisiae M-his-florum</i> strain 
	described in: V. Baby, F. Labroussaa, J. Brodeur, D. Matteau, G. Gourgues, 
	C. Lartigue and S. Rodrigue, Investigation of whole-genome cloning and transplantation 
	using the quasi-minimal bacterium <i>Mesoplasma florum</i>, [under review]
	</p>
